---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import { contact, url } from '../data/site.js';
---
<Base title="Privacy policy" description="Offsure's anti-spoof and phishing policy, and the official channels we use to contact you." cta={false}>
  <PageHero
    title="Anti-spoof and phishing policy"
    lead="How to tell a genuine message from Offsure from one that only claims to be."
  />

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="prose">
        <p>We take the protection of our customers, subscribers, brand and reputation seriously. To prevent spoof email messages and keep the operation of our domains transparent, we have implemented this Anti-Spoof and Phishing Policy. It is a reference point for anyone who wants to verify how we use and safeguard our domains.</p>
        <p>The policy applies to all domains controlled and operated by our organization. We have implemented Trusted Sender Score so that our customers and subscribers can easily identify legitimate emails from our domains. The policy details each domain, including which domains we use to send email. Each domain's Trusted Sender Score profile is linked to the policy, with further information on how that domain is configured.</p>
        <p>We take unauthorized attempts to represent our domains seriously. If you receive an email, link or web page that appears to be from our domains but looks suspicious or unfamiliar, check this policy. If you are still unsure whether it is legitimate, <a href={url('/contact')}>contact us</a> to verify it.</p>
        <p>We are committed to continuously updating and improving our policies and procedures to keep communication with us secure and transparent.</p>

        <h2>SMS messaging</h2>
        <p>We communicate by SMS only through our official contact number, <a href="tel:+639221200613">+63 922 120 0613</a>. Messages from any other number claiming to be from our company are not legitimate and should be disregarded immediately.</p>

        <h2>Social messaging</h2>
        <p>We may occasionally send a direct message from these accounts:</p>
        <ul class="chips">
          {contact.socials.map((s) => (
            <li><a class="chip" href={s.href} target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="display:block;text-decoration:none">{s.label}</a></li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
